<style>
  .meet-colton {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 40px 20px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 40px;
  }
  .meet-colton__image {
    flex: 0 0 260px;
    max-width: 260px;
  }
  .meet-colton__image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center top;
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.12);
  }
  .meet-colton__text {
    flex: 1;
  }
  .meet-colton__text h2 {
    font-size: 28px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    color: #1a1a1a;
  }
  .meet-colton__text p {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #444;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .meet-colton__cta {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 16px;
    background: #1a1a1a;
    color: #fff;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  .meet-colton__cta:hover {
    background: #333;
    color: #fff;
  }
  @media (max-width: 749px) {
    .meet-colton {
      flex-direction: column;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px 16px;
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .meet-colton__image {
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      width: 55%;
      max-width: 240px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .meet-colton__image img {
      height: auto;
      aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
      object-position: center 20%;
      border-radius: 50%;
    }
    .meet-colton__text h2 {
      font-size: 22px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .meet-colton__text p {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .meet-colton__cta {
      padding: 12px 24px;
      font-size: 14px;
      width: 100%;
      text-align: center;
    }
  }
</style>

<div class="meet-colton color-{{ section.settings.color_scheme }}">
  <div class="meet-colton__image">
    {%- if section.settings.owner_image != blank -%}
      {{ section.settings.owner_image | image_url: width: 800 | image_tag:
        alt: 'Colton Nichols - Owner of Bubbas Mattress and Furniture',
        loading: 'lazy',
        widths: '352, 800'
      }}
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
  <div class="meet-colton__text">
    <h2>Meet Colton</h2>
    <p>I started Bubba’s back in 2021 and it’s been one of the best things I’ve ever done. I love what I do — helping people get nice furniture without paying crazy prices for it. Same Ashley pieces the big stores sell, just without all the markup. I’m at the store six days a week and I wouldn’t have it any other way.</p>
    <p>You’re not dealing with a sales team or some corporate 1-800 number — you’re dealing with me. I answer every call, I handle every delivery, and I make sure you’re taken care of start to finish. {{ section.settings.review_count }}+ five-star reviews from real Louisville families and counting.</p>
    <a href="tel:5024940376" class="meet-colton__cta">Call or Text Bubba — (502) 494-0376</a>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Meet Colton",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "owner_image",
      "label": "Owner photo"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "review_count",
      "label": "Review count",
      "default": "285"
    },
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "color_scheme",
      "label": "Color scheme",
      "default": "scheme-1"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Meet Colton" }]
}
{% endschema %}
